# Exported ABI of libccollections.so.1.
#
# There is one symbol on each line, in sorted order. To make
# this file again, run `make update_abi_baseline`. Commit the
# result together with the change whenever the public API gets a
# new symbol. Do not remove a line from this file, and do not
# change the signature of a symbol that is in it. Either change
# breaks every application that is already linked against this
# ABI version, and you must then increase VERSION_MAJOR in the
# root Makefile.
